{
  "hypothesis": {
    "id": "steer-preference-denominator-counter",
    "parent": "steer-authority-counter-rewire",
    "kind": "enabling",
    "title": "Add an unconditional preference-consultation denominator so preferenceExpressed=0 becomes interpretable",
    "description": "steps is now live but equals stepsUsedSum, and preferenceExpressed/preferenceHonored/honored/blockedByTimerGate remain 0 over 601k runs, so zero-vs-dead is still undecidable at the decision site. In spur-core/src/simulator/core/scheduler.rs, add steerAuthority.preferenceConsulted incremented unconditionally at every call site that queries any preference source (before any policy/gate short-circuit), and steerAuthority.preferenceSourceAbsent incremented on the branch where no source is configured. Serialize both via util_stats.rs/explorer.rs alongside the existing fields. Extend spur-core/tests/steer_authority_wiring.rs with the invariant: preferenceConsulted + preferenceSourceAbsent > 0 whenever steps > 0, and preferenceExpressed <= preferenceConsulted. Then re-run general_vr.json and record which branch is taken. No policy change, no new config field.",
    "category": "tooling",
    "buildsOn": [
      "util_stats",
      "scheduler step loop",
      "explorer serialization",
      "steer-authority-counter-rewire"
    ],
    "expectedGain": 6,
    "expectedCost": 1,
    "rationale": "Every steer/timer-gate hypothesis is currently judged on counters that are still structurally pinned at zero; a denominator converts 'all zeros' from an uninterpretable reading into a decisive statement about whether the consultation site executes at all. Without it the parent fix buys only export-path confidence.",
    "generalityArgument": "Counts scheduler preference-consultation events and their absent-source branch; keyed by scheduler control flow only, references no handler, message type, or protocol invariant.",
    "status": "proposed",
    "branch": null,
    "prUrls": [],
    "createdAtIso": "2026-08-29T23:05:00Z",
    "firingCounter": null,
    "notes": "Direct follow-on: parent's falsifier passed for steps but the four informative fields are still 0 and uncovered by the new test. [rejudged iteration 5338: Exactly the gap the rewire left open (steps==stepsUsedSum, four counters still 0 over 601k runs); an unconditional consultation denominator makes every future steer falsifier non-vacuous; falsifier is preferenceConsulted also 0.]"
  },
